      "notes": "No hardware-fit or browser/WebGL acceptance is implied by the retained CAD or CPU geometry checks. Factory display execution is independently recorded in product limitations; a model screen only shows the actual emulator framebuffer. No manufacturer3D model exists in the inspected official footprint streams. Photo-faced partial PCB represents18×28mm board without inferring hidden components or traces. Only front visible appearance is photo-backed. Rear geometry, component heights, antenna stack and FPC mating cavity remain unmodeled; UNKNOWN label is visible on rear. Header-M geometry has correct nine-per-side count and2.54mm pitch but estimated lengths; bare and-M assets are separately selected. BOOT is a genuine GPIO61 hit target. RESET is visually identified but uses the platform reset action; RGB is actual guest RMT output on GPIO60.",
